
SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf234
"Be on your guard, there will be more wolves hunting on these hills tonight."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_celebrimbor001
"Celebrimbor: This place... it must be forgotten..."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_celebrimbor002
"Celebrimbor: Perish with its memory..."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_celebrimbor003
"I feel the pull of the One! I hear his voice! Be gone!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_celebrimbor004
"Death! That is all I grant!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_celebrimbor005
"You cannot escape this doom!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_celebrimbor006
"Abandon all hope... it has forsaken you!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_celebrimbor007
"I forged wonders... and wrought only ruin! Such is the fate of all things!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_celebrimbor008
"It... is... ended..."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf232
"These are the ruins of Ost-in-Edhil... once an Elven center for trade and craftsmanship... "
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf233
"Then Sauron the Deceiver laid it to waste, and killed its lord: Celebrimbor, the creator of the Rings of Power."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_legolas069
"Memory lingers within these stones. Can you hear their slow lamentation?"
END

SCRIPT:MGAmonH_Aragorn030
"Wolves! We're under attack!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_aragorn289
"There is a cave here! We should seek shelter and recover our strength."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_boromir087
"These were no ordinary wolves hunting for food in the wilderness. How much further to the Mines?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gimli076
"Caves in the mountains are seldom unoccupied."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gimli077
"Then we should make haste! Balin will grant us shelter and protection from these mangy creatures!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_legolas098
"The wolves come again!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf272
"Draw your blades, and stand back to back!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf273
"I will shrivel you from tail to snout!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf274
"We are close to the walls of Moria."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_merry048
"We've found something."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_merry049
"Something from the past."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_merry050
"A bounty!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_merry051
"Look out! Here he comes!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_pippin148
"Oooh, that looks useful."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_pippin149
"Look at this! A treasure!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_pippin150
"I saw it first, Merry!"
END

