"This looks useful."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo153
"What is this?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo154
"This should help."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo155
"Is he gone!?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo156
"Strider!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_aragorn420
"Protect the hobbits!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_aragorn421
"Get the hobbits to safety!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf391
"What have we here?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf392
"Relics of the past."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf393
"This will prove useful."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf394
"Anguished memories of a bygone age... do not let them take you!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf395
"Still your wrath! Return to your slumber!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf396
"They have found peace."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf397
"Indeed. Let us move north while the light is with us."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_boromir112
"We should take this with us."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_boromir113
"What are they!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_boromir114
"Evil lingers in these lands."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_boromir115
"What was that noise?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_boromir116
"Aragorn, Gimli, with me!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gimli124
"This looks worth carrying to me."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gimli125
"Another treasure!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gimli126
"Argh! Spirits, all around!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gimli127
"Cut it down!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_legolas130
"We shouldn't tarry here."
END

SCRIPT:MGMoria_Merry005
"Watch out!"
END

